msgid ""
"This setting drops redundant information while maintaining most detail "
"objects (such as signs). Includes all hidden and AI only roads."
msgstr ""
"这项设置将会移除冗余的信息，保留大部分细节物体（比如路牌）。将会保留隐藏或仅 "
"AI 可行的道路。"

