msgid ""
"Keep the ETS2LA window on top of other windows. If you want to use the "
"visualization on a single monitor setup, this is recommended."
msgstr "让 ETS2LA 窗口始终显示在其他窗口之上。如果您使用单显示器设置并希望使用可视化"
"界面，建议启用此选项。"

